usage: benchmark_pipeline.py [-h] --model MODEL --output OUTPUT
                             [--runner RUNNER] [--prompt PROMPT |
                             --prompt-file PROMPT_FILE] [--seed SEED]
                             [--steps STEPS] [--precision {fp16,fp32,bf16}]
                             [--device {vulkan,cpu}]
                             [--vae-device {cpu,vulkan}]
                             [--vae-convolution {direct,sgemm}]
                             [--width WIDTH] [--height HEIGHT]
                             [--threads THREADS] [--gpu GPU]
                             [--text-device {cpu}] [--text-down-vector]
                             [--dit-weights {auto,device,host}]
                             [--gpu-reserve-mib GPU_RESERVE_MIB]
                             [--dit-cache-mib DIT_CACHE_MIB]
                             [--ram-reserve-mib RAM_RESERVE_MIB]
                             [--model-loading {default,stdio,mapped}]
                             [--nvidia-sampling-index NVIDIA_SAMPLING_INDEX]
                             [--no-gpu-sampling] [--timeout TIMEOUT] [--trace]
                             [--pe-model PE_MODEL]
                             [--pe-max-tokens PE_MAX_TOKENS]
                             [--pe-prompt-file PE_PROMPT_FILE]
                             [--latent LATENT] [--noise-sha256 NOISE_SHA256]
                             [--input-image INPUT_IMAGE]
                             [--input-image-sha256 INPUT_IMAGE_SHA256]
                             [--decoded-rgb-sha256 DECODED_RGB_SHA256]
                             [--strength STRENGTH]
                             [--resize {stretch,fit,crop}]

Run one native prompt-to-PNG job with saved inputs and bounded resource
sampling.

options:
  -h, --help            show this help message and exit
  --model MODEL
  --output OUTPUT
  --runner RUNNER
  --prompt PROMPT
  --prompt-file PROMPT_FILE
  --seed SEED
  --steps STEPS
  --precision {fp16,fp32,bf16}
  --device {vulkan,cpu}
  --vae-device {cpu,vulkan}
  --vae-convolution {direct,sgemm}
  --width WIDTH
  --height HEIGHT
  --threads THREADS
  --gpu GPU             Native Vulkan device index; independent of NVIDIA
                        sampling index
  --text-device {cpu}
  --text-down-vector
  --dit-weights {auto,device,host}
  --gpu-reserve-mib GPU_RESERVE_MIB
  --dit-cache-mib DIT_CACHE_MIB
  --ram-reserve-mib RAM_RESERVE_MIB
  --model-loading {default,stdio,mapped}
  --nvidia-sampling-index NVIDIA_SAMPLING_INDEX
                        Whole-device diagnostic only; not matched Vulkan
                        allocation data
  --no-gpu-sampling     Disable optional NVIDIA diagnostics, e.g. for other
                        GPU vendors
  --timeout TIMEOUT
  --trace               Diagnostic only; formal paired timing requires trace
                        disabled
  --pe-model PE_MODEL
  --pe-max-tokens PE_MAX_TOKENS
  --pe-prompt-file PE_PROMPT_FILE
                        Optional PE input; currently unsupported by the native
                        CLI
  --latent LATENT       Saved little-endian FP32 initial noise; required for
                        formal comparison
  --noise-sha256 NOISE_SHA256
                        Expected frozen SHA256 of --latent; required for
                        formal comparison
  --input-image INPUT_IMAGE
                        Frozen img2img source image
  --input-image-sha256 INPUT_IMAGE_SHA256
                        Expected frozen SHA256 of --input-image
  --decoded-rgb-sha256 DECODED_RGB_SHA256
                        Expected SHA256 after decoding --input-image as RGB
  --strength STRENGTH   Img2img strength in (0,1]
  --resize {stretch,fit,crop}
